- The virtual file system tools, large-result eviction, task/subagent delegation,
  summarization, tool-call patching and their prompt and tool-description texts are
  ported from deepagents 0.7.32, with the summarization prompt, token-count heuristic
  and message formatting from langchain 1.4.8 and langchain-core 1.7.4
  (Copyright (c) LangChain, Inc., MIT License,
  https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents,
  https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain). The license text is in
  agents/mojo/LICENSES/langchain-MIT.txt; ported files carry a header naming it.
